{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"850779383656218636","content":"If you look at the races with an innate swim speed (and therefore unaffected by a lot of the 'underwater rules', we have Tritons which are basically merfolk with legs. Sea Elves, which are  more or less water elves and traditionally tied to the Elemental Plane of Water. Locanth a literal fish person (primarily based of a celocanth but have seen them reflavored as other  fish), Lizardfolk who primarily live in murky swamps so transitioning between land and water is more the vibe (such as cross or gators), and potentially Simic Hybrids as it is an option but not a standard trait.","created_at":"2021-08-27T17:17:37.481000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880863640209752094","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
