{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850779383656218636","content":"ITs also really rough balancing races with free move speeds that aren't walking.  Flight breaks games, and should never be allowed all the time on a race (making AArokrakra the only race completely banned in adventurers league last i looked).  Climb, swim, and burrow are situational.  Worthless a majority of the time, game breaking when useful.\n\nI had a character with move speed of ~80, and a swim and climb speed equal to walk.... there basically was no terrain i couldn't just ignore (I also had ring of jumping, so i could jump around 80 feet with a 10 foot running start).  So I think WotC tries to avoid using move speeds","created_at":"2021-08-27T17:29:20.519000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880866588964827237","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
