{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"850779383656218636","content":"If you look at it like this all four official shifter sub races offer the same things:\n+2 and +1 in relevant stats to the beast they shift with. (2con1str for boars and bears vs 2str1dex for tiger or hyena, etc)\nOne profiency also relevant to the animal\nAnd whatever thier shifting bonus is. \n\nSo you'd have to sacrifice a profiency in order to grant the swim speed *or* only grant a swim speed while shifted, but with shifting only lasting fot 1 minute, is that really the primary benefit of the race you want to grant?","created_at":"2021-08-27T17:31:09.702000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880867046911524914","reply_to_id":"880864749351477308","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
